Hello!

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.580
I'm Iketeru Daga, your singer Oniisan.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:35.920
I'm Utano Tadano, your singer Oneesan.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.380
I'm Uramichi Omota, your gymnast Oniisan!

