00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.890
"Arm Through the Neck Hole"

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.890
"Arm Through the Neck Hole"!

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:47.680
Yay!

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.020
