--Hey! You're the best!
--♬ You in your low-rise pants
and scuffed chrome wallet chain ♬

00:14:53.810 --> 00:14:56.850
--Whose song is this?
--♬ You in your low-rise pants
and scuffed chrome wallet chain ♬

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.600
--Yasuko Oide... which was
--♬ You in your low-rise pants
and scuffed chrome wallet chain ♬

00:14:58.600 --> 00:14:59.730
--Utano Oneesan's stage name
when she was an <i>enka </i>singer.
--♬ You in your low-rise pants
and scuffed chrome wallet chain ♬

00:14:59.730 --> 00:15:02.230
